lib/API/Docker/API/Images.pm loads JSON::MaybeXS (lines 129, 133, 284) and MIME::Base64 (line 285) with runtime require inside method bodies. Neither is a runtime-resolved plugin class or an optional dependency -- both are declared in cpanfile and loaded unconditionally elsewhere in the distribution -- so this is require used purely to defer cost, which getty-perl-core forbids. Hoist both to top-level use. Found during the cpanfile audit (ticket 5).
